From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ryan Murray <ryan@aurorasilicon.org>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 13:29:01 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: pci: apple,pcie: Add the T8132 compatible

The T8132 device tree and the driver use "apple,t8132-pcie" on its own,
as T8140 does, but the binding does not list it. dtbs_check then reports
that the PCIe node of every T8132 board matches no schema.

List it next to apple,t8140-pcie.

Fixes: a5573b48122b ("PCI: apple: match the T8132 controller")
Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Ryan Murray <ryan@aurorasilicon.org>
(cherry picked from commit a6cb1e7e871bb177668fd1b4eed0dc0dec845298)
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/pci/apple,pcie.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/pci/apple,pcie.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/pci/apple,pcie.yaml
index b3234aa020..285a1a93cf 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/pci/apple,pcie.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/pci/apple,pcie.yaml
@@ -62,6 +62,7 @@ properties:
           - const: apple,t6020-pcie
       - const: apple,t6020-pcie
       - const: apple,t8140-pcie
+      - const: apple,t8132-pcie
       - const: apple,t8103-pciec
       - items:
           - const: apple,t8112-pciec
